ss=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xJlAU6YI\">查询起始时间，格式：yyyy-MM-dd，时间跨度最大90天</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DoIZ3dwj\">查询截止时间，格式：yyyy-MM-dd，时间跨度最大90天</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zOljtYsR\">筛选条件</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">level_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6fTiZbUk\">评论层级，不传返回所有评论，可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-eeYIjXMT\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4kBi1giU\"><code>LEVEL_ALL</code> 所有等级</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-KmDWV6LQ\"><code>LEVEL_ONE</code> 一级评论</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-iYZFndSR\"><code>LEVEL_TWO</code> 二级评论</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">author_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cFaNJPAT\">抖音号，一次最多查询100个抖音号id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">item_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fJptZCvv\">营销视频id列表，一次最多100个，可通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1729983667746823\" target=\"_blank\">获取抖音授权关系</a>】获取item_id和视频相关信息</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">hide_status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4rZHJFJu\">隐藏状态，不传返回全部，可选值:</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-LllajlJ1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NUgLlTK7\"><code>ALL</code> 全部</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RdjAL4UK\"><code>HIDE</code> 已隐藏</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-EfoPAT0M\"><code>NOT_HIDE</code> 未隐藏</li></ul></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-kF5C9PUj\" id=\"h346b9f0-kF5C9PUj\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Ftools%2Fcomment_metrics%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20advertiser_id%20%3D%20ADVERTISER_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20start_time%20%3D%20START_TIME%5Cn%20%20%20%20end_time%20%3D%20END_TIME%5Cn%20%20%20%20level_type%20%3D%20LEVEL_TYPE%5Cn%20%20%20%20author_ids_list%20%3D%20AUTHOR_IDS%5Cn%20%20%20%20author_ids%20%3D%20json.dumps(author_ids_list)%5Cn%20%20%20%20item_ids_list%20